Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard scene: real panels on the house roof and the
 terrace roof

The house picture at the top of the dashboard now draws exactly as many panels
as are read: SolarEdge optimizers (cloud) on the house roof, Hoymiles panels on
a terrace roof next to the house, each with its live power in W and a glow by
its share of rated power, plus the power of each inverter below.

